# Image-generation working/debug artifacts accumulate in this directory
# (candidates, *-checker, *-grid-compare, masks, crops, zoom-compares, etc).
# Keep them on disk locally, but exclude everything from git AND the published
# npm package EXCEPT the adopted game sprites listed below.
#
# Adopting a NEW sprite? Add a matching `!name.png` line here, otherwise it will
# be ignored. This is intentional: inclusion is opt-in so debug output never
# ships in the package.
*
!.gitignore
!ally-earth.png
!ally-earth-damaged.png
!ally-fire.png
!ally-fire-damaged.png
!ally-water.png
!ally-water-facing.png
!ally-water-facing-slit.png
!ally-wind.png
!ally-wind-damaged.png
!dark-knight.png
!dark-mage.png
!demon-lord.png
!dragon.png
!dullahan.png
!ghoul.png
!goblin.png
!grim-reaper.png
!hero.png
!hero-battle.png
!hero-relax.png
!ogre.png
!orc.png
!skeleton.png
!slime.png
!succubus.png
!witch.png
!wolf-beastwoman.png
